This software is an academic project developed for the final semester of the MCA program at Vellore Institute of Technology (VIT).

I'm making this code public because I believe in open learning. If you're a fellow student or developer, you are completely free to read the code, study the architecture, and use it to learn how this system was built.

To keep things fair and protect the integrity of the project, I just ask for two simple things:
1. Please don't submit this code as your own work for your university assignments or academic grading.
2. Please don't use this project for commercial purposes.

Happy coding!

